{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212110","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421211001:1":{"text":"평범한 방법은 통하지 않을 것 같습니다. 페리엘이라면 분명 기발한 아이디어를 숨겨두었겠지요.","source_cn":"看来一般的方法并不适用，斐利尔应该又添加了自己的奇思妙想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A0FE7F72711CD78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421211002:1":{"text":"페리엘 님은 항상 그러셨어요. 평범한 것도 신기하게 바꾸곤 하셨으니까요.","source_cn":"斐利尔大人总是这样，会把普通的东西变得神奇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23AECAF53FC4B372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421211003:1":{"text":"맞습니다. 이상하지만... 귀여운 장난을 많이 쳤었죠.","source_cn":"这就是他，喜欢搞些奇怪但又……可爱的小把戏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2887013D2D8CF80F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421211004:1":{"text":"맞아요! 페리엘 님은 대단한 제사장님이셨지만 약간... 천진난만한 구석이 있으셨잖아요.","source_cn":"没错！斐利尔大人明明是很厉害的祭司，却总是想一些……像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC31B377C26EE2CE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421211005:1":{"text":"한번은 제단 옆의 장식용 꽃을 나비로 만들어 버리셨다니까요!","source_cn":"有一次，他还把祭庭旁的装饰花变成了飞舞的小蝴蝶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A493CD4F1AEBF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docum